`,o.jsx(l.p,{children:"Sometimes, the best food stories begin with plans that don't go as expected."}),`
`,o.jsxs(l.p,{children:["One evening, my cousin and I decided that pizza would be the perfect dinner. After discussing the options for quite a while, we settled on ",o.jsx(l.strong,{children:"Oven Story Pizza"}),". We carefully selected a few pizzas and side dishes, added everything to the cart, and decided to place the order around ",o.jsx(l.strong,{children:"8:30 PM"}),"."]}),`
